{
  "project": {
    "name": "Garment Eyelet and Washer",
    "slug": "garment-eyelet",
    "version": "1.0.0",
    "engine": "cadquery",
    "description": {
      "en": "A 3D-printed two-part garment eyelet: a flanged barrel that passes through the fabric stack, plus the plain toothless washer it is set against on the reverse. This is the rigid hard good the Fashion Cabinet `garment-eyelet` notion places and bridges to here for its geometry — sized so a garment's finished lace hole and seam-allowance stack drive the finding.\n\nOfficial Visualizer and Configurator: Yantra4D",
      "es": "Un ojillo de dos piezas impreso en 3D: un cuerpo con pestaña que atraviesa el espesor de la tela, más la arandela lisa contra la que se remacha por el revés. Es el avío rígido que la noción `garment-eyelet` de Fashion Cabinet coloca y al que se puentea aquí — dimensionado para que el ojal terminado y el espesor de la prenda determinen el avío.\n\nVisualizador y configurador oficial: Yantra4D"
    },
    "thumbnail": "/projects/garment-eyelet.webp",
    "difficulty": "beginner",
    "tags": [
      "garment-eyelet",
      "eyelet",
      "grommet",
      "washer",
      "lacing",
      "corset",
      "drawstring",
      "hardware",
      "finding",
      "wearable",
      "hyperobject",
      "commons"
    ],
